</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>His precious blood is sprinkled there,</l><l>Before and on the throne;</l><l>And His own wounds in heav’n declare</l><l>His work on earth is done.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>’Tis finished!” on the cross He said,</l><l>In agonies and blood;</l><l>’Tis finished: now He lives to plead</l><l>Before the face of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>’Tis finished!” Here our souls can rest,</l><l>His work can never fail;</l><l>By Him, our Sacrifice and Priest</l><l>We enter through the veil.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
